          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "how it works",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_ni6C7r": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>as a cooldown university leader, you'll:</h2><ul><li>build a run club that's completely <em>your</em> vibe</li><li>host runs, socials, and campus events</li><li>collaborate with brands like <strong>Red Bull, Altra, and more</strong></li><li>build real connections with brands you could one day work for</li><li>unlock paid opportunities tied to events, partnerships, and growth</li><li>meet cool people across campus (and beyond it)</li><li>go for a group run, then grab beers after</li></ul><h2>cooldown provides:</h2><ul><li>brand credibility and national partnerships</li><li>marketing assets, templates, and guidance</li><li>apparel, sponsorship, and event support</li><li>direct access to the cooldown team</li><li>a network of leaders at other universities</li></ul><p>You bring the ideas. We help you turn them into something real.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
