            "text": "<h2></h2><p>this is for students who:</p><ul><li>want real experience <em>and</em> real opportunities<br/></li><li>are interested in startups, marketing, events, or brand work<br/></li><li>like the idea of building something that can grow<br/></li><li>want to make connections — and some money — along the way<br/></li></ul><p>no pace requirements. just show up and lead.</p>",
