            "title": "Bailey",
            "text": "<p>Bailey went to the University of Minnesota where she ran Cross Country and Track. Her main focuses were staying warm and not failing out. After forging her diploma in Canva, she created her own social media marketing agency. Although she is very self-driven, her actual driving skills remain subpar at best.</p>",
