            "title": "Daniel",
            "text": "<p>Daniel barely graduated from the University of North Carolina where he ran the 400m dash. Nowadays he focuses on breaking Strava records and running his real estate private equity company. You’ve probably driven by one of his self-storage facilities and thought, “who would ever want to own this.” His only role within Cooldown is helping with taxes and is honestly confused why he is on the website.</p>",
